${lifeEvents.map(e => `[${e.date}] ${e.description} {Planetary Node: ${e.planet || 'Calculating...'}}`).join('\n')}

=== MULTI-DIMENSIONAL ANALYSIS PROTOCOLS ===
You must cross-reference the subject's data through the following "Lenses of Reality":

